libva (1.3.1-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * debian/control:
    - Add automake (>= 1:1.3.2) to Build-Depends. Running autoreconf fails
      otherwise due to a bug that has been fixed in automake 1.3.2. (Closes:
      #749649)
